  "content": "<ul>\n<li>我回來了，帶著一個許多人要求的資源包回來，可搭配使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li>需求：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></li>\n<li>資源包僅在有更多人要求更新時，才會根據 Fresh 的內容進行更新</li>\n<li>支援所有版本。</li>\n<li>從 1.21.5 版本開始，你應該使用 0.2 版本。</li>\n<li>感謝你關注這些專案的開發進度</li>\n<li>圖標計畫共同專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-xaeros\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Xaero's</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-journey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Icon Journey</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h2>支持我：</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GodKyo98\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CzUp3Ee.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fgBP65uzSsM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/889524360992403506/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p><h2><strong>支援資源包：</strong></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-extensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations 擴充包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-skeleton-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh 骷髏物理</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
